{"id":"59685d062adf2748","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","title":"Subgroup","display":"df-subgroup — Subgroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-subgroup","aliases":["58-df-subgroup","Subgroup"],"display":"df-subgroup — Subgroup","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-subgroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-subgroup</span><span>Subgroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subgroup — Subgroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(G,H,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq G\">\\(H\\subseteq G\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)\">\\(\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)\\)</span>（群运算在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\times H\">\\(H\\times H\\)</span> 上的限制）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\)</span>（本文件定义的子群谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subgroup} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\nH\\subseteq G\\land\nH\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\mathrm{Group}_S\\bigl(H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)\\bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subgroup} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\nH\\subseteq G\\land\nH\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\mathrm{Group}_S\\bigl(H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)\\bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient operation is an explicit argument; the restricted operation supplies the group structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> without an unbound inverse notation.</li>\n<li>Normal: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gHg^{-1} = H\">\\(gHg^{-1} = H\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g \\in G\">\\(g \\in G\\)</span>; kernel of homomorphism</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 有限，则 Lagrange 定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|G|=|H|\\,[G:H]\">\\(|G|=|H|\\,[G:H]\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|H|\">\\(|H|\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[G:H]\">\\([G:H]\\)</span> 都整除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|G|\">\\(|G|\\)</span>；无限群情形不能作这种整数整除断言。</li>\n<li>Coset: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gH = \\{gh : h \\in H\\}\">\\(gH = \\{gh : h \\in H\\}\\)</span>; partition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H \\leq G\">\\(H \\leq G\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Robinson, A Course in the Theory of Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},